-cli-q6.1--plan","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-q6","agent_clan_generation":"20261125125232","agent_session":"bob-cli-q6.1","agent_session_role":"plan","bead_id":"bob-cli-q6.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-q6[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Bank as a proper property card: folded Setup, hidden native [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Properties, and the `_` fold key[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The bank card on bank.md owns the note top as a title-slot property[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]card whose Setup folds by default (problems stay visible), native [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Obsidian Properties hide behind the fail-open coordinator, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]guarded bare `_` folds the card's own section on bank, album, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]record, area, and project cards.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bank_property_card_fold.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/bank_property_card_fold.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-q6[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-q6/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared fold kit, the `_` key, the command, and album Schema[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]fold-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold-core: add the 240s fold kit (state helper, node-based registry, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold row), species foldDefault, the guarded `_` arm and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]toggle-card-details command plus Command Mode row, and move album Schema[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]onto the kit with tests, e2e, docs, and the vimrc comment.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Setup collapses by default and the folded card stays honest[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-fold[dim] · [dim][/dim]after fold-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-fold: bank Setup resolves through the fold helper (collapsed when [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]healthy, self-opening and still toggleable when broken), gains the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared fold row with an attention chip, and fixes the gap tone, rule [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]numbering, ids, and stale-notice placement.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The bank card moves into the title slot and owns the title[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-title[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bank-fold[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-title: new 248cb title mixin adopts the title slot with an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]emoji-splitting identity model and bank recognizer, retires the badge, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]moves the edit action into the kicker as ⊞ Setup, adopts the real hue [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]walk, and releases cleanly in Source mode.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hide native Properties on bank.md behind the fail-open gate[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-takeover[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bank-title[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-takeover: spike bank.md YAML parity in real Obsidian, add bank to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the 240q coordinator, acquire and release ownership from the bank host, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]promote the bank-native e2e to full takeover verification, flip docs, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and apply the decision-gated glossary corrections.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The `_` key reaches record, area, and project folds[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]fold-family[dim] · [dim][/dim]after fold-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold-family: register record, area, and project folds with the kit (look[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per family_fold_look), give the foot's `-` disclosure the same hover [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]keycap, and cover each kind in unit and e2e tests and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Area strip, screenshot review, and passive-rendering proof[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]bank-polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bank-takeover, fold-family[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bank-polish: render the authored-only area strip on the bank card, prove[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]folding is passive, review light/dark wide/narrow screenshots across the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]family, sweep docs, and write the optional key-family decision record.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-q6","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-q6.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-q6.1"},"source_run_id":"run-0a8d600fc40d9c3e01563245b741fd1e","started_at":"2026-11-25T17:53:27.467381+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"5db96e563b9dbefccb0f62f2f8a104917d2556b5d97380a1651d6472b7e8ce48","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-q6.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"c3091d781cfa2249882b7826a50577d7d444cf32ce8f01321f1426d7138e03a1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-q6.land/meta.json","siz